  If $\Lm(p_i')$ are not pairwise distinct, suppose $\Lm(p_i') = \Lm(p_j')$ with
  $\Lm(p_i) > \Lm(p_j)$.
  Replace $p_i'$ with $p_i' \ltcoeff(p_j') - p_j' \ltcoeff(p_i')$.
